# Frontend production env — set these in the Vercel/Netlify dashboard,
# NOT in a committed file.
#
# Public URL of the deployed FastAPI backend, no trailing slash.
# Must be https in production (browsers block mixed content from an https page).
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com

# Optional: browser error tracking (Todo-Review P1 #5). Sentry project DSN
# (Settings → Client Keys). Empty = off and the SDK is not shipped to users.
# A future Content-Security-Policy must allow connect-src to *.ingest.sentry.io.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN=
